"The smith knows Markus is a Mana Manipulator, a kind so rare he marvelled Drathok found one."
"The smith pushed his own mana into Markus's Spirit-etched claymore; it tore energy out of him."
"Only a Mana Manipulator can safely feed a blade etched by Markus; the smith collapsed retching."
"The smith and Markus plan to sell conduit swords powered by Spirit-filled stones, for 80 gold or more."
